<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 3.86 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday through three credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.430 bln  13 days     27.46 pct</p>
<p>    1.430 bln  12 days     27.51 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day	25.46 pct</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
